-- akn:hc_1/p2 Letterhead: Ministry of Education; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 Letterhead: teaching staff administration; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p4 Letterhead: senior division for teaching personnel; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 The circular's title; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p6 The circular's date, 6.4.2014; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p7 Announces that the Director-General's instructions on contractor employment follow; the instructions are not in this text (see p8), so it sets no rule here.
